pdf-to-pdfa — validators, one command each, verdicts verbatim (round 028)
veraPDF 1.28.2 (greenfield, OpenJDK 27) — the validator this repo's ledger said did not exist.
engine output: colour.pdf through the rail's own 'Convert to PDF/A' (default 2b), dev :5271.
local output: the tool's own fallback, through runPdfTool with Ghostscript refused.

== 1. control: the untouched source, PDFA-2B profile (must fail) ==
$ java -cp verapdf-gui.jar org.verapdf.apps.GreenfieldCliWrapper -f 2b -v /tmp/triage/colour.pdf
